{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","version":"2.1.0","runs":[{"tool":{"driver":{"name":"CodeQL","organization":"GitHub","semanticVersion":"2.25.1","notifications":[{"id":"py/baseline/expected-extracted-files","name":"py/baseline/expected-extracted-files","shortDescription":{"text":"Expected extracted files"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Files appearing in the source archive that are expected to be extracted."},"defaultConfiguration":{"enabled":true},"properties":{"tags":["expected-extracted-files","telemetry"]}},{"id":"cli/file-coverage-baseline","name":"cli/file-coverage-baseline","shortDescription":{"text":"File coverage baseline telemetry"},"fullDescription":{"text":"File coverage baseline telemetry"},"defaultConfiguration":{"enabled":true}},{"id":"cli/platform","name":"cli/platform","shortDescription":{"text":"Platform"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Platform"},"defaultConfiguration":{"enabled":true}}],"rules":[{"id":"py/augur/openapi-python-client/pass1-path-traversal","name":"py/augur/openapi-python-client/pass1-path-traversal","shortDescription":{"text":"openapi-python-client pass 1: path traversal"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Finds untrusted OpenAPI document content (info.title, schema titles/refs, operation tags - fetched via --url or read via --path and parsed by yaml.safe_load) flowing into filesystem paths of the generated client tree: the project/package directory joins (Path.cwd() / project_name, project_dir / package_name), the models module file names (models_dir / f\"{module_name}.py\") and the raw-tag endpoint module file names (api_dir / f\"{tag}.py\"), and from there into .mkdir() receivers, .write_text() receivers and the shutil.rmtree(package_dir) argument. No containment, canonicalization or root check exists anywhere in the audited package (openapi-python-client 0.5.2), so a document title/tag containing \"..\" segments, path separators or an absolute prefix escapes the intended CWD root. Sources, sinks, barriers (none exist) and the two additional taint steps (pathlib '/' joins, Project field flow) are rendered from the reviewed Pass 1 labels in iris/labels/labels.json - see report/query_generation_notes.md for the label-to-predicate mapping and the documented recall limitations (the parse-side tag source S24 is not connected to the :235/:237 sinks by any reviewed label; those sink sites still alert via the title-derived base directory path)."},"defaultConfiguration":{"enabled":true,"level":"error"},"properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-022","external/cwe/cwe-023","external/cwe/cwe-036","external/cwe/cwe-073"],"description":"Finds untrusted OpenAPI document content (info.title, schema\n   titles/refs, operation tags - fetched via --url or read via --path and\n   parsed by yaml.safe_load) flowing into filesystem paths of the generated\n   client tree: the project/package directory joins (Path.cwd() /\n   project_name, project_dir / package_name), the models module file names\n   (models_dir / f\"{module_name}.py\") and the raw-tag endpoint module file\n   names (api_dir / f\"{tag}.py\"), and from there into .mkdir() receivers,\n   .write_text() receivers and the shutil.rmtree(package_dir) argument.\n   No containment, canonicalization or root check exists anywhere in the\n   audited package (openapi-python-client 0.5.2), so a document title/tag\n   containing \"..\" segments, path separators or an absolute prefix escapes\n   the intended CWD root. Sources, sinks, barriers (none exist) and the\n   two additional taint steps (pathlib '/' joins, Project field flow) are\n   rendered from the reviewed Pass 1 labels in iris/labels/labels.json -\n   see report/query_generation_notes.md for the label-to-predicate mapping\n   and the documented recall limitations (the parse-side tag source S24 is\n   not connected to the :235/:237 sinks by any reviewed label; those sink\n   sites still alert via the title-derived base directory path).","id":"py/augur/openapi-python-client/pass1-path-traversal","kind":"path-problem","name":"openapi-python-client pass 1: path traversal","precision":"medium","problem.severity":"error"}}]},"extensions":[{"name":"iris/openapi-python-client-cwe22","semanticVersion":"0.0.1","locations":[{"uri":"file:///C:/Users/lzh/Desktop/github/PyVul-main/iris_manual/Path_Traversal/openapi-python-client/iris/","description":{"text":"The QL pack root directory."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackRoot"]}},{"uri":"file:///C:/Users/lzh/Desktop/github/PyVul-main/iris_manual/Path_Traversal/openapi-python-client/iris/qlpack.yml","description":{"text":"The QL pack definition file."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackDefinitionFile"]}}]},{"name":"codeql/python-all","semanticVersion":"7.0.4","locations":[{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/python/ql/lib/","description":{"text":"The QL pack root directory."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackRoot"]}},{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/python/ql/lib/qlpack.yml","description":{"text":"The QL pack definition file."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackDefinitionFile"]}}]},{"name":"codeql/threat-models","semanticVersion":"1.0.47","locations":[{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/shared/threat-models/","description":{"text":"The QL pack root directory."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackRoot"]}},{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/shared/threat-models/qlpack.yml","description":{"text":"The QL pack definition file."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackDefinitionFile"]}}]}]},"invocations":[{"toolExecutionNotifications":[{"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"end_to_end_tests/golden-master/my_test_api_client/client.py","uriBaseId":"%SRCROOT%","index":1}}}],"message":{"text":""},"level":"none","descriptor":{"id":"py/baseline/expected-extracted-files","index":0},"properties":{"formattedMessage":{"text":""}}},{"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"openapi_python_client/schema/components.py","uriB